    "Description": "PA-14 / W2 witness. Every shipped asset agrees with FieldLayout by luck: no corpus asset declares a type whose CLR alignment differs from \u0060SizeBytes switch { 1 =\u003E 1, 2 =\u003E 2, \u003C= 4 =\u003E 4, _ =\u003E 8 }\u0060. This asset declares four that do, so the runtime layout gate has something to fail on.",
